    {
      "title": "# 2019-20",
      "content": "Sir/Madam,\nThis has a reference to APH Clause 7.38 wherein Mandatory Disclosures as per Annexure – 10 shall be displayed in the website of each Technical Institute. Display of information submitted to AICTE (including the accreditation status and Board of Governors) along with mandatory disclosures in the Website of the Institution is essential as per APH 2020-21.\nThis Office has randomly checked for the same and found Mandatory Disclosure of Old Version or not able to trace on the website of the various institutions.\nHence, this is to inform all Technical Institutions under SCRO Hyderabad to adhere with the norms & regulations of the AICTE and the compliance may be reverted back within 10 days."
    },
